        "activity.left": {
            "localizations": {
                "en": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                        "state": "translated",
                        "value": "@%@ left"
                    }
                },
                "fr": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                        "state": "translated",
                        "value": "@%@ a quitté le combat"
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "activity.disqualified": {
            "localizations": {
                "en": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                        "state": "translated",
                        "value": "@%@ was disqualified"
                    }
                },
                "fr": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                        "state": "translated",
                        "value": "@%@ a été disqualifié"
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "Comments and reactions refresh live. Feed loads ten posts at a time and loads more as you scroll. Pull down to fetch the latest posts. Notifications open the exact post. You now has Activity with posts, comments, reactions and timestamped membership history.": {
            "localizations": {
                "en": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                        "state": "translated",
                        "value": "Comments and reactions refresh live. Feed loads ten posts at a time and loads more as you scroll. Pull down to fetch the latest posts. Notifications open the exact post. You now has Activity with posts, comments, reactions and timestamped membership history."
                    }
                },
                "fr": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                        "state": "translated",
                        "value": "Les commentaires et réactions s’actualisent en direct. Le fil charge dix publications à la fois, puis la suite quand vous faites défiler. Tirez vers le bas pour actualiser les publications. Les notifications ouvrent la publication concernée. L’onglet Vous propose Activité, avec les publications, commentaires, réactions et l’historique daté des participants."
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "Translate": {
            "localizations": {
                "fr": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                        "state": "translated",
                        "value": "Traduire"
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "Posts and comments in another language now have a translation icon beside their actions on iOS 17.4 or later.": {
            "localizations": {
                "fr": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                        "state": "translated",
                        "value": "Les publications et les commentaires dans une autre langue affichent désormais une icône de traduction à côté de leurs actions, à partir d’iOS 17.4."
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "Feed comments can be sorted by most comments or most recent. Most comments is the default.": {
            "localizations": {
                "fr": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                        "state": "translated",
                        "value": "Les commentaires du fil se trient par plus de commentaires ou plus récents. Plus de commentaires est le choix par défaut."
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "Most comments": {
            "localizations": {
                "fr": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                        "state": "translated",
                        "value": "Plus de commentaires"
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "The Feed can show a post to everyone signed in, not only people in your fights.": {
            "localizations": {
                "fr": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                        "state": "translated",
                        "value": "Le fil peut maintenant afficher un message pour tout le monde connecté, pas seulement les personnes dans tes combats."
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "Broadcast": {
            "localizations": {
                "fr": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                        "state": "translated",
                        "value": "Annonce"
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "Write one post. Everyone signed in sees it on Feed.": {
            "localizations": {
                "fr": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                        "state": "translated",
                        "value": "Écris un message. Toutes les personnes connectées le voient dans Fil."
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "This post appears on Feed for everyone signed in.": {
            "localizations": {
                "fr": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                        "state": "translated",
                        "value": "Ce message apparaît dans Fil pour toutes les personnes connectées."
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "Opening FitFight invites you to the shared Steps fight and any suggested fights. They show on New. You get a notification with the name, no scores, and you can accept when you are ready.": {
            "localizations": {
                "fr": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                        "state": "translated",
                        "value": "Dès l'ouverture, FitFight t'invite au défi Pas partagé et aux défis suggérés. Ils apparaissent dans Nouveau. Tu reçois une notification avec le nom, sans scores, et tu peux accepter quand tu es prêt."
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "Bars, line, histogram, and pace now use the same confirmed Fight scores as the oval. A teammate without daily history is a gap, not a blank graph.": {
            "localizations": {
                "fr": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                        "state": "translated",
                        "value": "Barres, ligne, histogramme et allure utilisent maintenant les mêmes scores confirmés que l’ovale. Un coéquipier sans historique quotidien apparaît comme un trou, pas un graphique vide."
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "So far": {
            "localizations": {
                "fr": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                        "state": "translated",
                        "value": "Jusqu’ici"
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "Joining a suggested Fight now syncs your steps. Profile history opens the selected round, and Feedback comment counts open the discussion.": {
            "localizations": {
                "en": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                        "state": "translated",
                        "value": "Joining a suggested Fight now syncs your steps. Profile history opens the selected round, and Feedback comment counts open the discussion."
                    }
                },
                "fr": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                        "state": "translated",
                        "value": "Rejoindre un Fight suggéré synchronise désormais vos pas. L'historique du profil ouvre la manche choisie, et le nombre de commentaires dans Feedback ouvre la discussion."
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "Profiles now show the Fights you both still belong to. Leaving a Fight removes it from Fights together.": {
            "localizations": {
                "en": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                        "state": "translated",
                        "value": "Profiles now show the Fights you both still belong to. Leaving a Fight removes it from Fights together."
                    }
                },
                "fr": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                        "state": "translated",
                        "value": "Les profils affichent les Fights auxquels vous participez encore tous les deux. Quitter un Fight le retire des Fights en commun."
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "Suggested Fight invitations stay joinable, and rematches keep their original number of days across clock changes. Private Fight history protects participant identities.": {
            "localizations": {
                "en": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                        "state": "translated",
                        "value": "Suggested Fight invitations stay joinable, and rematches keep their original number of days across clock changes. Private Fight history protects participant identities."
                    }
                },
                "fr": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                        "state": "translated",
                        "value": "Les invitations aux Fights suggérés restent accessibles et les revanches conservent leur durée en jours malgré les changements d'heure. L'historique des Fights privés protège l'identité des participants."
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "Fights together": {
            "localizations": {
                "en": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                        "state": "translated",
                        "value": "Fights together"
                    }
                },
                "fr": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                        "state": "translated",
                        "value": "Fights en commun"
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "No Fights together yet": {
            "localizations": {
                "en": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                        "state": "translated",
                        "value": "No Fights together yet"
                    }
                },
                "fr": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                        "state": "translated",
                        "value": "Aucun Fight en commun pour le moment"
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "This installation": {
            "localizations": {
                "fr": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                        "state": "translated",
                        "value": "Cette installation"
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "Follow iPhone": {
            "localizations": {
                "fr": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                        "state": "translated",
                        "value": "Suivre l’iPhone"
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "Appearance": {
            "localizations": {
                "fr": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                        "state": "translated",
                        "value": "Apparence"
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "Fight status labels follow your language immediately, even when a refresh fails. Fight names and user-written stakes stay exactly as entered.": {
            "localizations": {
                "fr": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                        "state": "translated",
                        "value": "Les libellés de statut des fights suivent immédiatement ta langue, même si l’actualisation échoue. Les noms des fights et les gages saisis restent exactement tels quels."
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "Development build": {
            "localizations": {
                "fr": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                        "state": "translated",
                        "value": "Version de développement"
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "Version": {
            "localizations": {
                "fr": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                        "state": "translated",
                        "value": "Version"
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "preferences.version": {
            "localizations": {
                "en": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                        "state": "translated",
                        "value": "%@ · build %@"
                    }
                },
                "fr": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                        "state": "translated",
                        "value": "%@ · build %@"
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "Dark": {
            "localizations": {
                "fr": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                        "state": "translated",
                        "value": "Sombre"
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "The beta uses a separate database. Accounts, fights, progress, and preferences do not sync automatically with the App Store version, even when you use the same Apple ID.": {
            "localizations": {
                "fr": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                        "state": "translated",
                        "value": "La bêta utilise une base de données séparée. Les comptes, fights, progrès et préférences ne sont pas synchronisés automatiquement avec la version App Store, même avec le même identifiant Apple."
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "Installed from": {
            "localizations": {
                "fr": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                        "state": "translated",
                        "value": "Installée depuis"
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "Language and appearance are saved to your account and follow you on your devices.": {
            "localizations": {
                "fr": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                        "state": "translated",
                        "value": "La langue et l’apparence sont enregistrées sur ton compte et te suivent sur tes appareils."
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "Language changes keep your iPhone’s regional formats and preserve unfinished fights and posts.": {
            "localizations": {
                "fr": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                        "state": "translated",
                        "value": "Les changements de langue conservent les formats régionaux de ton iPhone et tes brouillons de fights et de publications."
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "Language": {
            "localizations": {
                "fr": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                        "state": "translated",
                        "value": "Langue"
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "Couldn’t save your preferences. Your previous settings are unchanged.": {
            "localizations": {
                "fr": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                        "state": "translated",
                        "value": "Impossible d’enregistrer tes préférences. Tes réglages précédents sont conservés."
                    }
