        "Reopen this feedback with its existing votes and discussion. People can vote and comment again.": {
            "extractionState": "manual",
            "localizations": {
                "fr": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                        "state": "translated",
                        "value": "Rouvrez ce retour en conservant ses votes et sa discussion. Les votes et commentaires seront à nouveau possibles."
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "Keep this feedback, its votes, and its discussion in Archived. New votes and comments will close. You can reopen it later.": {
            "extractionState": "manual",
            "localizations": {
                "fr": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                        "state": "translated",
                        "value": "Conservez ce retour, ses votes et sa discussion dans les archives. Les nouveaux votes et commentaires seront fermés. Vous pourrez le rouvrir plus tard."
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "This feedback is archived. Votes and comments are closed.": {
            "extractionState": "manual",
            "localizations": {
                "fr": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                        "state": "translated",
                        "value": "Ce retour est archivé. Les votes et commentaires sont fermés."
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "Suggested fights use compact invitation cards. Tap a card to see the details before joining.": {
            "extractionState": "manual",
            "localizations": {
                "fr": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                        "state": "translated",
                        "value": "Les Fights suggérés utilisent des cartes d’invitation compactes. Touchez une carte pour voir les détails avant de rejoindre le Fight."
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "Find feedback with one filter button. See features and bugs together, sort by votes or date, and browse archived posts. Delete your own feedback; admins can archive, reopen, or delete any post.": {
            "extractionState": "manual",
            "localizations": {
                "fr": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                        "state": "translated",
                        "value": "Retrouvez les retours grâce à un seul bouton de filtre. Affichez ensemble les fonctionnalités et les bugs, triez par votes ou par date et consultez les archives. Supprimez vos propres retours ; les administrateurs peuvent archiver, rouvrir ou supprimer toute publication."
                    }
                }
            }
        },
